      "text": "Back in Bellwether, rain tapped against Ninja's jacket as she walked past shuttered shopfronts. Through the bakery window, Ada was wiping down a counter. She raised one hand when she saw Ninja pass. Ninja returned the gesture. It was a small exchange, not quite a friendship, and she was grateful for how little it asked of her. At the corner, a warm light fell across the wet pavement. The Crooked Lantern.",
